### B1模块 - 自然语言查询和价格比较API测试

# 基础URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### ============================================
### 1. 自然语言查询测试
### ============================================

### 测试1: 搜索降血糖药物
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/nlq-search?q=我需要降血糖的药
Content-Type: application/json

### 测试2: 搜索便宜的维生素
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/nlq-search?q=便宜的维生素D
Content-Type: application/json

### 测试3: 搜索糖尿病相关补充剂
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/nlq-search?q=适合糖尿病患者的补充剂
Content-Type: application/json

### 测试4: 搜索血糖仪和试纸
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/nlq-search?q=血糖仪试纸
Content-Type: application/json

### 测试5: 搜索二甲双胍（药物名称）
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/nlq-search?q=二甲双胍
Content-Type: application/json

### 测试6: 搜索鱼油补充剂
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/nlq-search?q=omega-3鱼油
Content-Type: application/json

### 测试7: 搜索血糖监测器械
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/nlq-search?q=血糖监测
Content-Type: application/json

