GET {{baseUrl}}/products/compare-prices?q=鱼油
Content-Type: application/json

### 测试12: 比较采血针价格
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/compare-prices?q=采血针
Content-Type: application/json

### 测试13: 比较胰岛素注射笔针头价格
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/compare-prices?q=胰岛素注射笔针头
Content-Type: application/json

### 测试14: 比较镁补充剂价格
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/compare-prices?q=镁补充剂
Content-Type: application/json

